  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1 egg, beaten",
    "2 tablespoons water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KVV9cjQdkApACEpBcqAWrVxF5pI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-11899-basic-pasta-4x3-step-01--9eab2a9a60404627ae298732f9ef10f8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11899/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour and salt in a medium bowl. Make a well in the center and add beaten egg. Mix well until a stiff dough forms, adding up to 2 tablespoons water if needed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/P0AS-f5r-csCPJt13egvF6VXXWo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-11899-basic-pasta-4x3-step-02-1f9827a322ba4d39b6ab7e4c21ff7a9c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11899/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Knead dough on a lightly floured surface until smooth, 3 to 4 minutes. Wrap dough and let rest for 30 minutes to 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/St99qMaxNwYAKPa4yMLEFnUbW8o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-11899-basic-pasta-4x3-step-03-7d3c45ca5e424a0e8fc46b6f02903022.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11899/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll dough by hand or with a pasta machine to desired thickness, then cut into strips of desired width and length.",
